Surface coverings have various compositions and designations in the building art. In composition they can vary from vegetable fiber to metal. In designation, such terms as sheets, panels, and partition are used with hardboard, gypsum board, plasterboard, wall board, etc. It is understood that the invention extends to the installation and finishing of any surface covering or partition in the building art and is not to be limited by such terms as wall board which is commonly used for both walls and ceilings.
